+## Acceptance
+
+- **migration_lint first**: `python/migration_lint.py` upgraded as the first commit — matches manifest full paths plus `$SCRIPT_DIR/<basename>.sh` derived forms (no repo-wide bare-basename substring); ship-pr.sh blocks deletion only for live invocation/source forms, not comments; `docs/python-migration.md` updated to match. `python/test_migration_lint.py` covers `$SCRIPT_DIR` detection + cross-dir false-positive negative.
+- **CLI surface**: ~40 `(domain, verb)` rows registered in `python/cli.py` `_REGISTRY`; CLI parsing stays thin; all logic in typed library modules; `cli.py` top-level imports remain argparse/importlib/sys.
+- **Exact contract parity** for every gap/partial verb per the mapping tables: raw-vs-`emit_kv` stdout shape; usage exits preserved (merge-pr/ci-rerun-failed/ci-decide exit 1, phantom-probe-with-warn exit 2); force-push full `ForcePushResult.status` → exit map; `git count-commits` raw integer stdout + `COUNT_COMMITS_STATUS_FILE`; ci-status fail-open + `gh pr checks` text fallback; gh-run-logs unredacted tail-100 + exit 3; create-pr `PR_TITLE` on new+existing; ci behind-count fail-open + usage exit 2; check-main-sync 0/1/2; git-sync-local-main 0/1 only; branch-info `HEAD_SHA`+`CURRENT_BRANCH`; check-phantom-dirty side-effect-free vs phantom-probe append.
+- **Hard cutover, no shims**: every non-ship-pr live consumer repointed to `python3 cli.py` in the same change (root/skills/.claude bash callers use a local-root fallback; literal `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}` only in markdown/orchestrator prose); `scripts/ship-pr.sh` untouched; Python internals (`checks.py`, `ci_monitor.py`, `finalize.py`) call typed functions, not the CLI subprocess; `phantom.probe_with_warn` subprocesses the existing `append-execution-issue.sh` (not ported).
+- **Tests**: harness white-box semantics ported to colocated pytest; each retargeted `test-*.sh` passes once as a parity gate before its script is deleted; `test-implement-rebase-macro.sh` and `test-implement-structure.sh` pins retargeted to the CLI forms.
+- **Deletion safety**: Deferred-to-E1 closure scripts (incl. `check-remote-branch`) retained with verbs but NOT deleted; only zero-live-caller scripts deleted + their `.sh`/`.md`/`test-*.sh` appended to `python/migrated-scripts.tsv`.
+- **Gates green**: `make lint`, `make py-lint`, `make py-test`, `make lint-retired-scripts`.
